    },
    {
      "id": "LEGION-WITNESS-ACCOUNTING",
      "kind": "document",
      "document_id": "7c31e9933d3bb486b267ba81e9ff3a26faf85f47d1240af791b99e61a5bc6798",
      "title": "SUN_SOL_Orientation_Atlas.md",
      "source_id": "756f07b8874af89bc5f8ba247cb20b67e3d1b7da98eb35819bdd253247da75f2",
      "source_path": "C:\\Users\\Brend\\Documents\\ChatGPT\\SUN\\data\\raw\\recovered\\f07f6e78ad08c09559939d044f382c5fb15a88ca56d10f2a6f5d060475e908fb\\SUN_SOL_Orientation_Atlas.md",
      "source_sha256": "f07f6e78ad08c09559939d044f382c5fb15a88ca56d10f2a6f5d060475e908fb",
      "char_start": 14797,
      "char_end": 15956,
      "exact_quote": "### 6.2 Legion counts: witness selection\n\nEach total below is independently computed from all 72 primary command counts. Paimon's additional mention of 25 accompanying legions is kept separate from his primary count of 200. Sums of command counts do not establish disjoint memberships.\n\n| Dataset / witness | Sum | Status |\n|---|---:|---|\n| Repository and uploaded CSV | 2,648 | All 72 values match |\n| [1916 de Laurence edition](https://www.gutenberg.org/files/72679/72679-h/72679-h.htm) | 2,645 | Complete transcription vector |\n| [Peterson, Sloane 3825 main text](https://www.esotericarchives.com/solomon/goetia.htm) | 2,618 | Complete transcription vector |\n| Repository with Ose alone changed 3→30 | 2,675 | Controlled hybrid, no complete witness adjudicated |\n\nThe 1916 vector changes only Ose 3→30 and Belial 80→50 relative to the repository: 2648+27−30=2645. Peterson instead changes Morax 30→36, Focalor 30→3, Vine 36→35 and Valac 38→30: 2648+6−27−1−8=2618. Ose 3 is source-attested, not a repository error. The same total can arise from different vectors; the full readings must travel with it. The machine-readable witness comparison is included.\n\n",
      "quote_sha256": "cae8ed5258e978ea3ca4562ebaf0ebaf8f06c427a58cd51bfe34f697b53f4e52",
      "extractor": "utf8",
      "locator_boundary": "Offsets and quote refer to stored extracted document; original source bytes separately hash-verified.",
      "source_role": "Recovered research artifact; source statements and imported interpretations are not silently promoted into historical facts."
    },
    {
      "id": "CHINESE-NATIVE-ORDER-VS-ADAPTER",
      "kind": "document",
      "document_id": "eb81c784171cc18b5e848078a93560db4422145033839cfb4ccd5c6bc3134065",
      "title": "Chinese_Cosmological_Units_and_Musical_Tree_Addresses.docx",
      "source_id": "03f0379cbb66614ceb1b95a29c315a164127f7daeb598e8be317ebf85fe75d10",
      "source_path": "C:\\Users\\Brend\\Documents\\ChatGPT\\SUN\\data\\raw\\archive\\SUN_Universal_Archive\\Library\\DEEP_INVENTORY\\Chinese_Cosmological_Units_and_Musical_Tree_Addresses.docx",
      "source_sha256": "c4be5c78e4e8dc75cce48911f6b322cccea13cf49d21dc8cf6395498cf92d343",
      "char_start": 1154,
      "char_end": 4075,
      "exact_quote": "Non-negotiable safeguards\nNative order and analytic address remain visibly separate. A clock position is a test address, not a claim that ancient Chinese authors used this wheel.\n“Parent, sibling, descendant” means structural relation unless a source explicitly gives genealogical language.\nNo Chinese unit is declared identical to a sefirah. The Tree supplies functions and positions; Chinese sources supply content.\nThe Fludd/Kepler/STCH bridge remains upstream: Fludd supplies cross-scale projection; Kepler supplies quantitative simultaneous relation; STCH supplies the completed harmonic synthesis. Nothing here substitutes “Fludd alone” for that bridge.\nTwelve-lü ratios are treated as generative standards, not as proof that the universe literally is a modern equal-tempered keyboard.\nA blind-test hit must be scored against precommitted address, nature, relation, and story/function—not resemblance noticed after target research.\nThe two orders\nA. Native production sequence\nThe clearest compact chain comes from the Huainanzi’s cosmological presentation, read alongside Laozi 42:\nDao / nebulous void  →  space–time  →  primordial qi / One  →  clear Heaven + turbid Earth  →  combined essences and yin–yang  →  four seasons  →  ten thousand things\nWuxing, sheng/ke, twelve lü, and ganying are not simply four more rungs added beneath this chain. They are correlative fields, operators, standards, and transmission laws that organize multiple rungs at once. [1–6]\nB. Analytic clockwise Tree-wheel\n\nRead clockwise from 12. The center is not a thirteenth outer station: it is the embodied listener-regulator through whom the whole field becomes actionable.\n\nClock index\nClock\nChinese unit\nTree address\nFunction\nFit\n12\nDao / nebulous void\nMonad\nsource / indeterminacy\nStrong\n1\nOne / primordial qi\nKeter\nfirst generative unity\nStrong\n2\nHeaven / clear rising yang\nChokhmah\nexpansive pole\nStrong\n3\nEarth / heavy congealing yin\nBinah\nreceptive/forming pole\nStrong\n4\nCombined essences / relational Three\nDa’at\ncoupling/interface\nProvisional\n5\nsheng 生 / generation\nChesed\npositive coupling\nStrong as operator\n6\nke 克 / regulation\nGevurah\nconstraint/negative feedback\nStrong as operator\n7\nwuxing 五行 field\nTiferet\ncoordinated collective mode\nStrong, horizontal\n8\nFour seasons / calendar recurrence\nNetzach\ncyclic persistence\nStrong\n9\nTwelve lü 十二律\nHod\nmeasure, naming, address\nStrong\n10\nganying 感應\nYesod\nresonant transmission\nStrong, distributed\n11\nwanwu 萬物 / ten thousand things\nMalkuth\nmanifest multiplicity\nStrong\ncenter\nHuman / sage-ruler\nAdam\nembodied feedback and attunement\nQualified\nScoring result by address\nStrong means the Chinese evidence independently supplies the core function. “Strong as operator,” “horizontal,” and “distributed” are successes with topology warnings. “Provisional” or “qualified” must not be counted as exact hits in the blind phase unless the prediction also anticipates the qualification.\n\n",
      "quote_sha256": "722ace59433417983133e07818eac69a1c1a8fdf1331ba83ce3f30dda0ea6dc0",
      "extractor": "stdlib-openxml-native-cells-v1",
      "locator_boundary": "Offsets and quote refer to stored extracted document; original source bytes separately hash-verified.",
      "source_role": "Recovered research artifact; source statements and imported interpretations are not silently promoted into historical facts."
    },
    {
      "id": "CHINESE-CONDITIONAL-SOURCE-LOCK",
      "kind": "document",
      "document_id": "f61d2ead943f3f0632d20ff16109269bf8e20ecd1105f7dac1a0d230f7b9bd67",
      "title": "Chinese_Tree_of_Life_Calibration_Humanized_Source_Locked.pdf",
      "source_id": "166cc2a93e707bbc30dab822a9b3287d81505c2900e9a618377011aeb58295f1",
      "source_path": "C:\\Users\\Brend\\Documents\\ChatGPT\\SUN\\data\\raw\\nested\\98fa7c0d1d17267c37b3943680748ed6a949569ae60b4ad23e68605ae52faeef\\supporting_records\\source_files\\Chinese_Tree_of_Life_Calibration_Humanized_Source_Locked.pdf",
      "source_sha256": "28c5e34b11de2bc3b78ea7e56d2fd759270b7a5828c2020c33aedb312cae038c",
      "char_start": 342,
      "char_end": 5042,
      "exact_quote": "Result: conditional pass. The complete agreed stack—musical DNA → Fludd/Kepler/STCH bridge → Tree-of-Life \nadapter → Chinese instantiation—fits the early Chinese material as a functional operator graph. It does not fit as ten \nsuccessive Chinese beings or substances. Both conclusions are hard constraints on the model.\nPlain-language reading. The pass is conditional: the Chinese material supports the stack as a graph of functions and \nrelations, while the same test rejects a reading of ten successive Chinese beings or substances.\n1. Scope and test discipline\nCalibration corpus. The upper sequence is frozen from the Laozi and the early Han Huainanzi; the musical mechanism is \nfrozen from the Lüshi Chunqiu and early Chinese pitch theory; wuxing and resonance are checked against modern specialist \nsummaries. Later religious Daoist pantheons, Pangu mythology, and Neo-Confucian taijitu systems are excluded from this \nfirst test. The Huainanzi is especially suitable because its chapters 3–5 are the most comprehensive surviving statement of \nearly Han cosmology, while chapter 6 develops resonance.[2][3]\nNon-identity rule. A Chinese term is not declared to be a sefirah. The test asks whether an independently attested Chinese \nfunction can occupy the same musical address. Labels are costumes; preserved relations are the evidence.\nPass condition. The stack passes only if the bridge remains intact and the adapter preserves the independent order and paired \nor cyclic relations without inventing a missing Chinese entity. A function may be local, horizontal, or distributed; forcing all \nfunctions into a chronological vertical ladder counts as a failure.\nPlain-language reading. The calibration is testing preserved function and relation, not identity of names. It passes only \nwhen the independent Chinese ordering and paired or cyclic relations survive without inventing a missing entity.\n2. Frozen architecture and musical DNA\nComposition order. The Fludd/Kepler/STCH bridge is neither optional nor deferred. It receives the musical DNA and \nsupplies the resolved relational field that the Tree addresses; only then is the Tree projected into a tradition-specific \nvocabulary.\nEach musical unit and each inter-unit relation are represented before any traditional names are introduced:\nHere ω is frequency, A amplitude, φ phase, τ rhythmic position, g a generator coordinate, and K coupling. The relation—not \nthe isolated tone—is the state space passed into the bridge.\nPlain-language reading. The order of operations is fixed: musical DNA enters the Fludd/Kepler/STCH bridge first, the Tree \naddresses that resolved relational field second, and tradition-specific Chinese vocabulary is applied only afterward.\n3. Frozen Chinese baseline\nThe abstract formula in Laozi 42 is: Dao produces One; One produces Two; Two produces Three; Three produces the ten \nthousand things.[1] The identity of “Three” is not fixed by that line, so the test may not silently define it as Heaven–Earth–\nHuman.\n\n[page:2]\nPage 2\nThe more articulated Huainanzi sequence is: Dao/nebulous void → space-time → primordial qi → separation into clear, \nbright, dispersing Heaven and heavy, turbid, congealing Earth → their combined essences and yin–yang → four seasons → \nten thousand things.[4] This gives the upper classes that were required before testing the adapter.\nPlain-language reading. The Chinese baseline supplies source, carrier, polarity, interaction, periodic differentiation, \nmeasured pitch/calendar address, manifest multiplicity, and embodied regulation - but the document does not treat those \nfunctions as proof of ten successive native entities.\nLevel Chinese unit or field Native function Status\n0 Dao / nebulous void Unformed source; not yet a counted \nmanifest unit Explicit\n1 Space-time / primordial qi / One First transmissible continuum or \ncarrier Explicit, terminology varies by text\n2a Clear, bright, dispersing qi → \nHeaven / yang tendency Expansive branch Explicit\n2b Heavy, turbid, congealing qi → \nEarth / yin tendency Contractive-forming branch Explicit\n3 Combined essences; yin–yang \ninteraction\nRelational field that generates \ndifferentiated cycles\nExplicit in Huainanzi; Laozi's \n‘Three’ remains open\n4 Four seasons Periodic differentiation Explicit\n5 Five phases and their correlations Dynamic, interdependent modes; \nfour-around-center organization Strong Han-period attestation\n6 Twelve pitch standards / calendar \naddresses\nMeasured generator lattice and \nrole/address system Explicit musical tradition\n7 Ten thousand things Manifest multiplicity Explicit\n8 Human / sage-ruler Embodied regulator inside the same \ncorrelative order\nStrong in Huainanzi and wuxing \nsources\n",
      "quote_sha256": "f7e1b43b4c5f7f4c37056e17a473724f391093e2b20b8f4544622babaaba8fcf",
      "extractor": "pypdf-pages",
      "locator_boundary": "Offsets and quote refer to stored extracted document; original source bytes separately hash-verified.",
      "source_role": "Recovered research artifact; source statements and imported interpretations are not silently promoted into historical facts."
    }
  ],
