            "paragraph_id": null,
            "section": "SHEMHAMPHORASH",
            "main_cell": false
          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "(16.) Zepar. —The Sixteenth Spirit is Zepar. He is a\r\nGreat Duke, and appeareth in Red Apparel and Armour,\r\nlike a Soldier. His office is to cause Women to love\r\nMen, and to bring them together in love. He also maketh\r\nthem barren. He governeth 26 Legions of Inferior\r\nSpirits, and his Seal is this, which he obeyeth when he\r\nseeth it.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "0f6b4f0d437b422dddc331dab9ffff0b414f92b49718ab455137b67d9bdfc8d4",
          "count_context": "ve Men, and to bring them together in love. He also maketh them barren. He governeth 26 Legions of Inferior Spirits, and his Seal is this, which he ob",
          "count_policy": "Remove superscript footnote markers and bracketed editorial alternatives for this main reading; choose first direct legion count. Retain brackets/source separately. Paimon secondary25 remains separately typed."
        },
        {
          "position": 17,
          "imported_comparison_name": "Botis",
          "legions_primary": 60,
          "additional_accompanying_legions": null,
          "selector": {
            "catalogue_position": 17,
            "paragraph_id": null,
            "section": "SHEMHAMPHORASH",
            "main_cell": false
          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "(17.) Botis. —The Seventeenth Spirit is Botis, a Great\r\nPresident, and an Earl. He appeareth at the first show\r\nin the form of an ugly Viper, then at the command of\r\nthe Magician he putteth on a Human shape with Great\r\nTeeth, and two Horns, carrying a bright and sharp\r\nSword in his hand. He telleth all things Past, and to\r\nCome, and reconcileth Friends and Foes. He ruleth over\r\n60 Legions of Spirits, and this is his Seal, etc.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "a45436eb544c04484dd78bf33f41c7708165d1b15703345ac77235787332b503",
          "count_context": "lleth all things Past, and to Come, and reconcileth Friends and Foes. He ruleth over 60 Legions of Spirits, and this is his Seal, etc.",
          "count_policy": "Remove superscript footnote markers and bracketed editorial alternatives for this main reading; choose first direct legion count. Retain brackets/source separately. Paimon secondary25 remains separately typed."
        },
        {
          "position": 18,
          "imported_comparison_name": "Bathin",
          "legions_primary": 30,
          "additional_accompanying_legions": null,
          "selector": {
