            "paragraph_id": null,
            "section": "SHEMHAMPHORASH",
            "main_cell": false
          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "(18.) Bathin. —The Eighteenth Spirit is Bathin. He\r\nis a Mighty and Strong Duke, and appeareth like a\r\nStrong Man with the tail of a Serpent, sitting upon a\r\nPale-Coloured Horse. He knoweth the Virtues of\r\nHerbs and Precious Stones, and can transport men suddenly\r\nfrom one country to another. He ruleth over 30\r\nLegions of Spirits. His Seal is this which is to be worn\r\nas aforesaid.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "98415dc07d930301ff41eac7e1b2be0672a137b871963064e78089faf6bf2dbf",
          "count_context": "s Stones, and can transport men suddenly from one country to another. He ruleth over 30 Legions of Spirits. His Seal is this which is to be worn as af",
          "count_policy": "Remove superscript footnote markers and bracketed editorial alternatives for this main reading; choose first direct legion count. Retain brackets/source separately. Paimon secondary25 remains separately typed."
        },
        {
          "position": 19,
          "imported_comparison_name": "Sallos",
          "legions_primary": 30,
          "additional_accompanying_legions": null,
          "selector": {
