            "paragraph_id": null,
            "section": "SHEMHAMPHORASH",
            "main_cell": false
          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "(21.) Marax. —The Twenty-first Spirit is Marax. He\r\nis a Great Earl and President. He appeareth like a\r\ngreat Bull with a Man’s face. His office is to make Men\r\nvery knowing in Astronomy, and all other Liberal Sciences;\r\nalso he can give good Familiars, and wise, knowing\r\nthe virtues of Herbs and Stones which be precious.\r\nHe governeth 30 Legions of Spirits, and his Seal is this,\r\nwhich must be made and worn as aforesaid, etc.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "2881d0a01119c229bb2f9d6b0c44c331e8e862edbaa3bd8c142de32f8bd1a62b",
          "count_context": "s, and wise, knowing the virtues of Herbs and Stones which be precious. He governeth 30 Legions of Spirits, and his Seal is this, which must be made a",
          "count_policy": "Remove superscript footnote markers and bracketed editorial alternatives for this main reading; choose first direct legion count. Retain brackets/source separately. Paimon secondary25 remains separately typed."
        },
        {
          "position": 22,
          "imported_comparison_name": "Ipos",
