            "paragraph_id": null,
            "section": "SHEMHAMPHORASH",
            "main_cell": false
          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "(22.) Ipos. —The Twenty-second Spirit is Ipos. He is\r\nan Earl, and a Mighty Prince, and appeareth in the\r\nform of an Angel with a Lion’s Head, and a Goose’s\r\nFoot, and Hare’s Tail. He knoweth all things Past,\r\nPresent, and to Come. He maketh men witty and bold. He governeth 36 Legions of Spirits. His Seal is this,\r\nwhich thou shalt wear, etc.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "fc44cd4bf7b34f48b8f19d22aa0605b9df6f9d9cfd60879bcda4d3e43b6125a1",
