        },
        {
          "position": 23,
          "imported_comparison_name": "Aim",
          "legions_primary": 26,
          "additional_accompanying_legions": null,
          "selector": {
            "catalogue_position": 23,
            "paragraph_id": null,
            "section": "SHEMHAMPHORASH",
            "main_cell": false
          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "(23.) Aim. —The Twenty-third Spirit is Aim. He is\r\na Great Strong Duke. He appeareth in the form of a\r\nvery handsome Man in body, but with three Heads; the\r\nfirst, like a Serpent, the second like a Man having two\r\nStars on his Forehead, the third like a Calf. He rideth\r\non a Viper, carrying a Firebrand in his Hand, wherewith\r\nhe setteth cities, castles, and great Places, on fire.\r\nHe maketh thee witty in all manner of ways, and giveth\r\ntrue answers unto private matters. He governeth 26\r\nLegions of Inferior Spirits; and his Seal is this, which\r\nwear thou as aforesaid, etc.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "cbf7574faa9f6e390a6efced9e11cff055680f93b07fc0856767ce92d71e17ab",
          "count_context": "ty in all manner of ways, and giveth true answers unto private matters. He governeth 26 Legions of Inferior Spirits; and his Seal is this, which wear ",
          "count_policy": "Remove superscript footnote markers and bracketed editorial alternatives for this main reading; choose first direct legion count. Retain brackets/source separately. Paimon secondary25 remains separately typed."
        },
        {
          "position": 24,
          "imported_comparison_name": "Naberius",
          "legions_primary": 19,
          "additional_accompanying_legions": null,
          "selector": {
