            "paragraph_id": null,
            "section": "SHEMHAMPHORASH",
            "main_cell": false
          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "(24.) Naberius. —The Twenty-fourth Spirit is Naberius.\r\nHe is a most valiant Marquis, and showeth in the\r\nform of a Black Crane, fluttering about the Circle, and\r\nwhen he speaketh it is with a hoarse voice. He maketh\r\nmen cunning in all Arts and Sciences, but especially in\r\nthe Art of Rhetoric. He restoreth lost Dignities and\r\nHonours. He governeth 19 Legions of Spirits. His Seal\r\nis this, which is to be worn, etc.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "f1117ea30658e7de42600b266ad4362a988099105d634e087dd2b749c4727a5b",
          "count_context": "cially in the Art of Rhetoric. He restoreth lost Dignities and Honours. He governeth 19 Legions of Spirits. His Seal is this, which is to be worn, etc",
          "count_policy": "Remove superscript footnote markers and bracketed editorial alternatives for this main reading; choose first direct legion count. Retain brackets/source separately. Paimon secondary25 remains separately typed."
        },
        {
