            "paragraph_id": null,
            "section": "SHEMHAMPHORASH",
            "main_cell": false
          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "(25.) Glasya-Labolas. —The Twenty-fifth Spirit is\r\nGlasya-Labolas. He is a Mighty President and Earl,\r\nand showeth himself in the form of a Dog with Wings\r\nlike a Gryphon. He teacheth all Arts and Sciences in an\r\ninstant, and is an Author of Bloodshed and Manslaughter.\r\nHe teacheth all things Past, and to Come. If desired\r\nhe causeth the love both of Friends and of Foes.\r\nHe can make a Man to go Invisible. And he hath under\r\nhis command 36 Legions of Spirits. His Seal is this, to\r\nbe, etc.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "33f33b15a100d711113b5ccac4c0be5229c1df9b1c37c9c6ed9d5cd88cbb120e",
          "count_context": "riends and of Foes. He can make a Man to go Invisible. And he hath under his command 36 Legions of Spirits. His Seal is this, to be, etc.",
          "count_policy": "Remove superscript footnote markers and bracketed editorial alternatives for this main reading; choose first direct legion count. Retain brackets/source separately. Paimon secondary25 remains separately typed."
        },
        {
          "position": 26,
          "imported_comparison_name": "Bune",
          "legions_primary": 30,
          "additional_accompanying_legions": null,
          "selector": {
