            "catalogue_position": 57,
            "paragraph_id": null,
            "section": "SHEMHAMPHORASH",
            "main_cell": false
          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "(57.) Osé , or Voso .—The Fifty-seventh Spirit is Oso,\r\nOsé, or Voso. He is a Great President, and appeareth\r\nlike a Leopard at the first, but after a little time he\r\nputteth on the Shape of a Man. His Office is to make\r\none cunning in the Liberal Sciences, and to give True\r\nAnswers of Divine and Secret Things; also to change a\r\nMan into any Shape that the Exorcist pleaseth, so that he that is so changed will not think any other thing than\r\nthat he is in verity that Creature or Thing he is changed\r\ninto. He governeth 30 Legions of Spirits, and this is\r\nhis Seal, etc.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "54199a46c0ae6eff8d9a58a7c4270aa643dd1ff8b1f81bf80130cfbd088bca40",
