          "legions_primary": 30,
          "additional_accompanying_legions": null,
          "selector": {
            "catalogue_position": 59,
            "paragraph_id": null,
            "section": "SHEMHAMPHORASH",
            "main_cell": false
          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "(59.) Oriax , or Orias .—The Fifty-ninth Spirit is\r\nOriax, or Orias. He is a Great Marquis, and appeareth\r\nin the Form of a Lion, riding upon a Horse Mighty and\r\nStrong, with a Serpent’s Tail; and he holdeth in his\r\nRight Hand two Great Serpents hissing. His Office is\r\nto teach the Virtues of the Stars, and to know the Mansions\r\nof the Planets, and how to understand their Virtues.\r\nHe also transformeth Men, and he giveth Dignities,\r\nPrelacies, and Confirmation thereof; also Favour\r\nwith Friends and with Foes. He doth govern 30 Legions\r\nof Spirits; and his Seal is this, etc.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "cf857f20dba84a4c866163d15ff355f7504932da1f78ca3e7197ffc5edef7381",
