            "paragraph_id": "baal",
            "section": "catalog",
            "main_cell": true
          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The first principall spirit is a king ruling in y East,\ncalled Bael . he maketh men goe Invisible, he ruleth\nover 66 Legions of Inferiour spirits, he appeareth in divers shapes,\nsomtimes like a Catt, sometimes like a Toad, sometimes like a man, &\nsometimes in all these formes at once. he speaketh very horsly.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "ceb029d20771cb3e3f0d96e57e58c9e9330bae1f93df26b57f00ff806f99806e",
          "count_context": "s a king ruling in y East, called Bael . he maketh men goe Invisible, he ruleth over 66 Legions of Inferiour spirits, he appeareth in divers shapes, s",
          "count_policy": "Remove superscript footnote markers and bracketed editorial alternatives for this main reading; choose first direct legion count. Retain brackets/source separately. Paimon secondary25 remains separately typed."
        },
        {
          "position": 2,
          "imported_comparison_name": "Agares",
          "legions_primary": 31,
          "additional_accompanying_legions": null,
          "selector": {
            "catalogue_position": 2,
            "paragraph_id": "agares",
            "section": "catalog",
            "main_cell": true
          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The second spirit is a Duke called Agares , he is under\ny power of y East and cometh up in the form of a fair\nOld man riding upon a Crocodill, very mildly, carrying a goshawke on\nhis fist. he maketh them runne that stand still, and fetcheth back\ny runnawayes. he can teach all Languages or Tongues presently, he\nhath power also to destroy dignities, both supernaturall &\nTemporall; & cause Earthquakes. he was of the order of Vertues;\nhe hath under his government 31 Legions &c: & this is [his] seale\nor Charecter w is to be worne as [a] Lamen.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "a2017a4b641d7d20fd7e4e7bdcfd402682b26cd4f1d084b4d3682c64f02d5a65",
          "count_context": "l; & cause Earthquakes. he was of the order of Vertues; he hath under his government 31 Legions &c: & this is seale or Charecter w is to be worne as L",
          "count_policy": "Remove superscript footnote markers and bracketed editorial alternatives for this main reading; choose first direct legion count. Retain brackets/source separately. Paimon secondary25 remains separately typed."
        },
        {
          "position": 3,
          "imported_comparison_name": "Vassago",
          "legions_primary": 26,
          "additional_accompanying_legions": null,
          "selector": {
            "catalogue_position": 3,
            "paragraph_id": "vassago",
            "section": "catalog",
            "main_cell": true
          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The Third spirit is a mighty prince, being of y same Nature as Agares, he is called Vassago , This spirit is of a good nature, & his office is to declare\nthings past and to come; and to discover all things hidden or lost &c:\nhe governeth 26 Legions of spirits. This is his seal.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "4a11512012aedde645dc48356ff4436343a86dbdbc01fdc9e3bb857eedfe99f2",
          "count_context": " things past and to come; and to discover all things hidden or lost &c: he governeth 26 Legions of spirits. This is his seal.",
          "count_policy": "Remove superscript footnote markers and bracketed editorial alternatives for this main reading; choose first direct legion count. Retain brackets/source separately. Paimon secondary25 remains separately typed."
        },
        {
          "position": 4,
          "imported_comparison_name": "Samigina",
          "legions_primary": 30,
          "additional_accompanying_legions": null,
          "selector": {
            "catalogue_position": 4,
            "paragraph_id": "gamigin",
            "section": "catalog",
            "main_cell": true
          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 4 spirit is called Gamigin , a great Marquise, he appereth in y forme of a litle\nhorse or asse and then into humane shape he putteth himself at y request of y Master and speaketh w a horse voice;\nhe teaches all Liberall siences, and giveth an<d> account of y dead soules of them that dye in sin . & he ruleth over 30 Legions\nof Inferiours &c. This is his seal, w is to be worne\nby the Magician when he Invocateth.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "9452048760f211284367d61fa43e82b44c41f7bb07325e54349da778869398f1",
          "count_context": "and giveth an<d> account of y dead soules of them that dye in sin . & he ruleth over 30 Legions of Inferiours &c. This is his seal, w is to be worne b",
          "count_policy": "Remove superscript footnote markers and bracketed editorial alternatives for this main reading; choose first direct legion count. Retain brackets/source separately. Paimon secondary25 remains separately typed."
        },
        {
          "position": 5,
          "imported_comparison_name": "Marbas",
          "legions_primary": 36,
          "additional_accompanying_legions": null,
          "selector": {
            "catalogue_position": 5,
            "paragraph_id": "marbas",
            "section": "catalog",
            "main_cell": true
          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 5 spirit is called Marbas -- he is a\ngreat presedent, and appeareth at first in y forme of a \ngreat Lyon: but afterwards putteth on humane shape at y Request of y Master he Answareth truly of Things hidden \nor secreet, he causeth deseases and cureth them againe & giveth \ngreat wisdome & knowledge in mechanicall arts, & changeth men \ninto other shapes he governeth 36 Legions of spirits. his seal is this.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "af96c2cbe42e09971f31876355a79b81803b912ef568a344d1bfb7694a89c373",
          "count_context": "sdome & knowledge in mechanicall arts, & changeth men into other shapes he governeth 36 Legions of spirits. his seal is this.",
          "count_policy": "Remove superscript footnote markers and bracketed editorial alternatives for this main reading; choose first direct legion count. Retain brackets/source separately. Paimon secondary25 remains separately typed."
        },
        {
          "position": 6,
          "imported_comparison_name": "Valefor",
          "legions_primary": 10,
          "additional_accompanying_legions": null,
          "selector": {
