            "paragraph_id": "valefar",
            "section": "catalog",
            "main_cell": true
          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 6 spirit is Valefar -- he is a Mighty\nDuke, & appeareth in y form of a Lion w a\nmans head Lowring, he is a good femiliar, but tempteth those he is\nfemiller with to steale, he governeth 10 Legions of spirets, this is\nhis seal to wearne constantly if you haue his familiarity. Else not.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "89caf4653409917e2af8cf329d27b24f1b769ffd83fbd9f1bcee9ad36eac8718",
          "count_context": "e is a good femiliar, but tempteth those he is femiller with to steale, he governeth 10 Legions of spirets, this is his seal to wearne constantly if y",
          "count_policy": "Remove superscript footnote markers and bracketed editorial alternatives for this main reading; choose first direct legion count. Retain brackets/source separately. Paimon secondary25 remains separately typed."
        },
        {
          "position": 7,
          "imported_comparison_name": "Amon",
          "legions_primary": 40,
          "additional_accompanying_legions": null,
          "selector": {
            "catalogue_position": 7,
            "paragraph_id": "amon",
            "section": "catalog",
            "main_cell": true
          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 7 spirit is Amon . he is a Marquis great in\npower & most strong, he at first appereth like a wolf with a\nserpents taile, vomiting out of his Mouth fleames of fire, but\nat y command of y Magician he putteth on y shape of a man, with dogs Teeth beset in a head like a Raven, or in a Ravens\nHead, hee telleth all things past & to come, and procureth love,\nand reconcileth controversies between friends & foes, & governeth\n40 Legions of spirits, his seal is thus, w is to be worne as\nafforesaid.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "3dee003b70064b0c353db15af07e5d2cf2e728d2f699007597d1894222c8da94",
          "count_context": "nd procureth love, and reconcileth controversies between friends & foes, & governeth 40 Legions of spirits, his seal is thus, w is to be worne as affo",
          "count_policy": "Remove superscript footnote markers and bracketed editorial alternatives for this main reading; choose first direct legion count. Retain brackets/source separately. Paimon secondary25 remains separately typed."
        },
        {
          "position": 8,
          "imported_comparison_name": "Barbatos",
          "legions_primary": 30,
          "additional_accompanying_legions": null,
          "selector": {
