          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 10 spirit is Buer , a great president\nand appereth in that is his\nshape when y is there,\nhe teacheth Phylosophy [both] Morall & Naturall, & y Logicall arts, & y vertues of all hearbes & plants,\n& healeth all distempers in Man, & giveth (familiars) good familiars,\nhe governeth over 50 Legions of spirits and this is his seale of obediance\nw you must weare when you call him to apperance.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "f77d66756c2da82b66bdea8a7e38666233eb8f25831c06fd1d3b96304fde598c",
