            "section": "catalog",
            "main_cell": true
          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 11 spirit is a great & strong duke called Gusoin , he appeareth like a Xenophilus [*zenophali] he\ntelleth of all things past, present & to come: he sheweth y meaning of all questions you can ask, he reconcileth friends and giveth\nhonour and dignity to any, and ruleth over 40 Legions of Spirits.\nhis seal is this, w weare as aforesaid &c.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "163f2bb4bbdccb632e159a3c058d3d23b6ae1121a7cf7be00fc0aab247eeecdb",
          "count_context": "an ask, he reconcileth friends and giveth honour and dignity to any, and ruleth over 40 Legions of Spirits. his seal is this, w weare as aforesaid &c.",
          "count_policy": "Remove superscript footnote markers and bracketed editorial alternatives for this main reading; choose first direct legion count. Retain brackets/source separately. Paimon secondary25 remains separately typed."
        },
        {
          "position": 12,
