            "section": "catalog",
            "main_cell": true
          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 12 spirit is Sitri , he is a great prince \n& appeareth at first with a Leopards face, and wings as a griffin.\nBut afterwards at y command of y exorcist,\nhe putteth on a humane shape very Beautifull, Inflaming Men with womens\nLove, and women with mens love, and causeth them to shew themselves Naked,\nif he [it] be desired, &c. he governeth 60 Legions of spirits, and\nhis seal to be worne is this.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "d20fff1ecb53b45e5a59c2cc09973d91077df733251683446a858cf333d86175",
          "count_context": " love, and causeth them to shew themselves Naked, if he be desired, &c. he governeth 60 Legions of spirits, and his seal to be worne is this.",
          "count_policy": "Remove superscript footnote markers and bracketed editorial alternatives for this main reading; choose first direct legion count. Retain brackets/source separately. Paimon secondary25 remains separately typed."
        },
        {
          "position": 13,
          "imported_comparison_name": "Beleth",
          "legions_primary": 85,
          "additional_accompanying_legions": null,
          "selector": {
            "catalogue_position": 13,
            "paragraph_id": "beleth",
            "section": "catalog",
            "main_cell": true
          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 13 spirit is called Beleth , he is a mighty\nking and terrable, ridding on a pale horse w Trumpets and\nall other kinds of Musicall Instruments playing before him, he is very\nfurious at his first apperance That is whilest y Exorcist\nallay his Courage, for to doe that, he must hold a hazel stick\nin his hand, streched forth towards y South & East quarters\nmaking a Triangle without y Circle, commanding him into it by\ny vertue of y Bonds & chaines of spirits\nhereafter following, & if he doe not come into y by your Threats, rehearse\ny Bounds & chaines before him, and then he will yeild\nobediance and come into it and doe what he is commanded by y Eorcist [Exorcist], yet he must receive him courteously, because he is\na great king & doe homage to him, as the kings and princes doe\nthat attend him, and you must have allwayes a silver Ring on the\nmiddle finger of the left hand, held against your face as they do for Amaimon,\nThis king Beleth causeth all y love that possible may be, both of\nMen and women till y Master Eorcist [Exorcist] hath had his\nmind fullfilled &c. he is of the order of Powers and governeth 85\nLegions of [102v] spirits, his Noble seal is this w is to be\nworne before you in the Time of working.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "af9b31c9c36534cc7a9f7b46b477a7d5fe1f98a042664a3c2b3018752141d45c",
          "count_context": " Eorcist hath had his mind fullfilled &c. he is of the order of Powers and governeth 85 Legions of spirits, his Noble seal is this w is to be worne be",
          "count_policy": "Remove superscript footnote markers and bracketed editorial alternatives for this main reading; choose first direct legion count. Retain brackets/source separately. Paimon secondary25 remains separately typed."
        },
