          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 14 spirit is called Leraye (or Leraje). he is a Marquize great in power shewing\nhim selfe in y likeness of an archer, cladd in green carring\n[carrying] a Bow and quiver, he causeth all great Battles &\ncontests, & causeth y wounds to putrifie that are [made]\nw arrows by archers this belongeth to he governeth 30 Legions of\nspirits, & his seale of obediance is this.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "0220945877e9fa2041a89a2c88d097d603cecc7d6f0aec5d99a5e3a46aae9090",
