          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 19 spirit is called Saleos , he is a great\nand mighty duke, & appeareth in [the] form of a gallant souldier,\nridding on a Crocodile, w a dukes crowne on his head peaceably\nhe causeth y love of women to men & men to women, he governeth\n30 Legions of spirits his seal is this, w must be worne before\nyou.",
