          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 21 spirit is called Morax he is a great\nEarle and a president, he appeareth like a great Bull w a mans\nface; his office is: to make men very knowling [sic] in Astronomy, and\nall y other Liberall siences; he can give good familiars and\n[very] wise, w know y vertues of hearbes &\nprecious stones he governeth 36 Legions of spirits, & his\nseal is to be made Thus and worne [as aforesaid].",
