            "main_cell": true
          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 23 spirit is called Aim , a great duke and strong, he appeareth in y forme \nof a very handsome man in Body, [but] w 3 heads, The first like a serpent y second like a man w 2 starrs in his forehead, The Third [head]\nis lik a Catt; he rideeth on a viper, carring a fire brand \nin his hand burning, whereth [wherewith] he sets Citties Castles & greate \nplaces on fire he maketh one witty [in] all manner of wayes, and giveth true\nanswares to privy matters, he governeth 26 Legions of Infernall\nspirits; his seal is thus to be made, and worne as a Lamen before\nyou.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "743b36c3a75cf811b06d654e8b916d80a8779f2333c90534eab96f3a94734010",
