            "main_cell": true
          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 25 spirit is called Glasya Labolas , he is a Mighty president & sheweth himselfe in y forme of a\ndog w wings like a griffin; he teacheth all arts in an Instant,\nand is an author of Blood shed & Manslaughter, he telleth all\nThings past & to come, if desired, & causeth love of friends\nand foes; he can make a Man goe Invisible, & he hath under his\nrule 36 Legions of spirits, his seal is this, y w weare as a Lamin.",
