          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 34 spirit is called Furtur [*Furfur], he is a \ngreat & mighty Earle, appearing in y forme of an hart w a firey [fiery] Taile; he never speaket [speaketh] Truth, except he be \ncompelled or brought up w in a Triangle, being compelled therein, he will take upon himselfe y forme of an angel being bidden; he speaketh with a hoarse voice, & will \nwillingly make love between man & wife he can raise Thunder, \nLightnings, Blasts and great Tempestuous stormes &c he giveth true \nanswares both of secreet and devine Things [105v] if commanded, and ruleth over 26 Legions of spirits, his seal\nis this which is to be worne as a Lamin &c.",
