          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 35 spirit is called Marchosias , he is a great and\nmighty Marquiz appering at first in [the] forme of a wolfe; having\ngriffins wings, and a serpents Taile, vomiting up fire out of his mouth\nBut afterwards at y command of y Exorcist,\nhe putteth on y shape of a man, and is a strong fighter he\ngiveth true answares to all questions, & is very faithfull to y Exorcist in doeing his Buisness, he was of y order of\ndominations he governeth 30 Legions of spirits, he Told his chiefe Master\nw w Salomon, that after 1200 yeares he hadd hopes\nto returne to y 7 Throne &: his seal is thus,\nto be made, & worne as a Lamin &c.",
