          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 43 spirit in order as Salomon commanded them into y Brazen vesel is called Sabnach he is a Mighty great Marquiz,\n& strong appearing in y forme of an armed souldier\nw a Lyons head, ridding on a pale couloured horse, his office\nis to build high Towers, Casteles and Citties, and to furnish them\nw armour, & to afflict men severall dayes w wounds & rotten sores full of wormes; he giveth good familiars at\ny command of y Exorcist he commandeth 50 Legions of\nspirits, his seal is Thus to be made, and worne as a Lamin &c.",
