          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 46 spirit is called Bifrons , he is an\nEarle and appeareth in y forme of a Monster at first but after\na while at y command of y Exorcist he putteth on\ny shape of a man, his office is to make one knowing in Astrology\n& geomitry & other arts & siences, & Teacheth y vertues of all hearbs, precious stones & woodes, he changeth y dead Bodyes & putteth Them into one another [anothers'] places, &\nlighteth candeles seemingly upon y graves of y dead\nhe hath under his command 6 Legions of spirits, his seal is this,\nw he w owne and submit unto &c.",
