          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 48 spirit is called Haagenti , he is\na great president appearing in the forme of a mighty Bull w griffins wings at first, But afterwardes at y command of the\nExorcist, he putteth on humane shape &c his office is to make men\nwise and to Instruct them in divers Things & to Transmute all\nmettales into gold, & change wine into water, & water [107v] into wine; he commandeth 33 Legions of spirits; his seal is Thus made,\n& to be worne as a Lamin &c.",
