          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 50 spirit in order is called Furcas , he\nis a knight & appeareth in y forme and similitude of a cruel\nold man w a long Beard and a hairy [*hoary] head, sitting on a pale\ncolloured horse, w a sharpe weapon in his hand; his office is\nto teach y art of Phylosophy, astronomy, Rhetoricl, logick,\nChyromancy & Pyromancy in all their partes perfectly, he hath under his\npower 20 Legions of spirits, his seal or Mark is this w make\n& weare as a Lamin.",
