          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 51 spirit in order is Balam , he is a Terrable,\ngreat & powerfull king, appearing w 3 heads, The first\nis like a Bulls, The second like a Mans, & y Third like\na Rams head he hath a serpents Taile, & Eyes flaming; riding upon\na furious Beare, carrying a gosh hawke on his fist, he speaketh w a hoarse voyce, giving True answares of Things past present &\nto come, he maketh men to goe invisible & w he governeth\n40 Legions of spirits his seal is Thus [to be] Made, & to be worne as\na Lamin &c.",
