          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 52 spirit [in order] is called Alloces --\nhe is a great & mighty strong duke, appearing in y forme of\na souldier ridding on a great horse; his face is like a Lyons, very redd,\nhaving Eyes flaming, his speech is hoarse & verry Bigg; his office is to\nteach y art of Astronomy, & all y Liberall\nsiences, he Bringeth good familiars & ruleth 36 Legions of spirits, his\nseal is Thus made, & [is] to be worne, &c.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "deac6b66b7c7f1731005acd57d33f3f9ef17053bc9a5dc0d7673d2f07c8bf966",
