            "main_cell": true
          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 53 spirit is called Caim , he is a great\npresident & appeareth in y forme of a Bird called a Thrush\nat first, but after a while he putteth on y shape of a man carring\nin his hand a sharp sword; he seemeth to answare in Burning ashes, he is a\ngood disputer, his office is to give men y understanding\nof all Birds, loweing of Bullocks, Barking of doggs & other Creatures,\n& also y Noise of waters, and giveth very true answares of \nThings to come; he was of y order of angels, & now Ruleth 30\nLegions of Infernall spirits; his seal is This, w wear as a\nLamin.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "4e96f72f08eebe6af5e18acde9bbf74c469658255e827013863b8b9b195f5683",
