          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 56 spirit is called Gemory , he is a strong and powerfull\nduke appearing in The forme of a Beautifull woman, w a Dutches\n[Duchess] Crownett Tyed about her middle, ridding on a great Camell, his office\nis to tell of all Things past present & to come, and of Treasure hidden\nand w it layeth in, & procureth y love of women,\nboth young & old, he governeth 26 Legions of spirits, his seal\nis Thus made, & worne as a Lamin before y Exorcist in [the]\nTime of working.",
