          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 63 spirit is called Andras , he is a great Marquiz\nappearing in y forme of an angell w a head like a\nBlack night Raven, ridding upon a black strong woolf, w a sharpe\nbright sword flourishing in his hand, his office is to sow discords,\nif y Exorcist hath not a care he will kill him and his fellows,\nhe governeth 30 Legions of spirits his seal is Thus, to be [made,\nand] worne as a Lamin before [thee] on you[r] Breast.",
