            "section": "catalog",
            "main_cell": true
          },
          "source_text_with_editorial_brackets": "The 72 spirit in order is called Andromalius he is\na great and Mighty Earle appearing in y form of a Man, holding a\nserpent in his hand, his office is to bring a Theefe \n& goods y are stolen, Back; and to discover all wickedness, and understand [*underhand] dealings,\n& to punish Theives & other wicked people, & to discover\nTreasure that is hidd, &c, he ruleth 36 Legions of spirits his seal is\nThis, w make & wear as a Lamin in time of acction\n&c.",
          "extracted_main_text_sha256": "712239c769bfd502a78e97d15466a9e9e0643cc66417dd6f1202ce50b489c22e",
